  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需要庫模組 <a style=\"font-size:24px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Collective (Fabric)</a> 和 <a style=\"font-size:24px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</span></strong></p>\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:center\"><br><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7518;text-align:center\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinite-trading\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7518;text-align:center\">這是 Fabric 1.16 和 1.17 版本的舊頁面。<br>新文件和更新已移至主項目頁面。<br>對於 Forge 版本以及 Fabric 1.18+，請點擊此處。</span> </strong> </a></div>\n<p><br><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;此模組是 <span style=\"color:#008000\"><a style=\"color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Vanilla Experience</a></span>的一部分。</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Infinite Trading 是一個極簡主義的模組，可防止村民交易鎖死，使它們始終可用並允許無限交易。我不確定他們從何處獲得物品，但只要涉及綠寶石就會找到方法。遊蕩商默認支援且啟用。這可以在配置中關閉。</span><br><br><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\">可配置：</span> <span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.information/wiki/how-to-configure-mods-(fabric)\" rel=\"nofollow\">(&nbsp;如何配置？&nbsp;)</a></span></strong><br>wanderingTraderInfiniteTrades&nbsp;</strong>(預設 = true): 當啟用时，遊蕩商的交易永不鎖機。<strong><br>villagerInfiniteTrades</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true): 当启用时，村民的交易永不锁机。<strong><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以購買任意數量的商品：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/infinite-trading/a.jpg\" width=\"812\" height=\"479\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/infinite-trading/b.jpg\" width=\"810\" height=\"475\"></strong></p>\n<p><br>------------------<br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載保持在 CurseForge 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a>提供所有可用模組的概述和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法追蹤每個模組單獨頁面的評論，因此已禁用評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對於問題、想法、建議或其他內容，請使用 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github仓库</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
